  "notes": "Modal is used to show a dialog or a box when you click a button.\n\nNeeds daisyUI installed (npm i -D daisyui, then @plugin \"daisyui\" in your CSS).\n\nOriginal file: https://github.com/saadeghi/daisyui/blob/master/packages/docs/src/routes/(routes)/components/modal/+page.md",
  "code": "<!-- The button to open modal -->\n<label for=\"my_modal_6\" class=\"btn\">open modal</label>\n\n<!-- Put this part before </body> tag -->\n<input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"my_modal_6\" class=\"modal-toggle\" />\n<div class=\"modal\" role=\"dialog\">\n  <div class=\"modal-box\">\n    <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold\">Hello!</h3>\n    <p class=\"py-4\">This modal works with a hidden checkbox!</p>\n    <div class=\"modal-action\">\n      <label for=\"my_modal_6\" class=\"btn\">Close!</label>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
